  "body": "This release builds the OPA binary artifacts with the latest version of Go (v1.27.2), its standard library, and the golang.org/x/net dependency (v0.60.0).\r\n\r\nSee these security advisories:\r\n- https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/U2fTuyDJznI\r\n- https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/ZPwCyRUuGBs\r\n\r\nFurthermore, it addresses a mismatch in how encoded slashes were handled in the input to a basic authorization policy and the Data API (#9323, reported by @abhishekkushwaha4u, fixed by @sspaink).\r\n\r\n\r\n",
